Output docs/assets/06-lsp-create-card.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1000
Set Height 560
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Frappe"

Type "nvim -u docs/vhs/demo-init.lua docs/vhs/demo/chapters/02_the_crossing.md"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "/Charybdis"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "ve"
Sleep 1s
Type " lc"
Sleep 3s
Sleep 2s
Type ":qa!"
Enter